    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pēdo</span></b> ,
		pĕpēdi
		(pēdĭtum), 3, v. n.
		for perdo, Sanscr. root pard-; Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρδω,
				πορδή</span>; cf. Germ. Furz; Engl. fart, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to break wind</i>,
